pany Name]\n\nNeed count around 350. Let's draft.\n\n[Date]\n\n[Vendor Contact Name]\n[Vendor Company Name]\n[Address]\n\nDear [Vendor Contact Name],\n\nI am writing on behalf of [Company Name], a small software company developing an open-source inference engine for machine-learning workloads. Our engine is designed to run large language models and other neural networks efficiently on consumer and workstation hardware, with a focus on transparent performance, reproducible results, and broad compatibility across GPU architectures.\n\nWe are requesting early access to your developer program for your new GPU. Early access would allow our team to begin driver, runtime, and compiler integration before the product is generally available. Because our engine is open source, our development cycle depends on stable hardware access, early documentation, and timely feedback channels. If we can begin work before launch, we can identify compatibility issues, optimize memory and kernel behavior, and provide users with a supported experience on day one. Delaying access until general availability would compress our testing window and increase the risk of post-launch defects, which would be undesirable for both our users and your customer base.\n\nIn return for early access, [Company Name] is prepared to provide concrete, useful feedback. We will share performance benchmarks for representative inference workloads, including throughput, latency,", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0007511217263527215], [868, -8.228652954101562]], [[1144, -8.821526535029989e-06], [14235, -13.093777656555176]], [[4087, -0.26398640871047974], [310, -1.5032519102096558]], [[1156, -0.0011618327116593719], [310, -6.879889011383057]], [[579, -0.02508862130343914], [25, -4.153113842010498]], [[1622, -0.0008637462160550058], [4237, -7.091785430908203]], [[25, -0.2807873785495758], [13, -1.4100807905197144]], [[3165, -0.0691293478012085], [9357, -3.068784236907959]], [[15440, -0.12205470353364944], [264, -2.163818120956421]]